<title>DENMARK: SAS 9-mo profit 1.257 bln SKR vs 2.145 bln.</title>
<headline>SAS 9-mo profit 1.257 bln SKR vs 2.145 bln.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30</p>
<p>		    (millions of Swedish crowns)</p>
<p>					   1996	  1995</p>
<p>Group Pre-tax result	     1.257  vs    2,145</p>
<p>Operating revenue		26,046   vs   26,748</p>
<p>Operating expenses	    -23,445   vs  -22,843</p>
<p>Depreciation		     -1,359   vs   -1,377</p>
<p>Financial items		    -136   vs     -277</p>
<p>Exchange rate differences	  71   vs     -251</p>
<p>Result after fin. items	 1,200   vs    2,084</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of carrier is Scandinavian Airlines System, H which is owned jointly by the governments of Sweden, Norway and Denmark and private investors. It said that it expected 1996 fourth quarter pre-tax profit similar to the 1995 fourth quarter 487 million Swedish crowns.</p>
</text>
